ma where the other copy runs the same algorithm on different inputs, and I'm asking whether my act has a causal edge into theirs. The essay's symmetry rule suggests yes, since the input differences don't change the decision structure, so I'd draw a subjunctive edge and then cooperate.\n\nWeighing the two options: with a symmetry edge the other copy's choice tracks mine, so cooperating gets 2 years instead of 4. Without that edge the other copy is treated as fixed, and defection dominates. The essay leaves this to judgment, but its own criterion, that an edge exists when the other reliably reasons about my output, points toward passing.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm treating this as a twin prisoner's dilemma where the other copy runs the same algorithm on different inputs, and I'm asking whether my act has a causal edge into theirs. The essay's symmetry rule suggests yes, since the input differences don't change the decision structure, so I'd draw a subjunctive edge and then cooperate.\n\nWeighing the two options: with a symmetry edge the other copy's choice tracks mine, so cooperating gets 2 years instead of 4. Without that edge the other copy is treated as fixed, and defection dominates. The essay leaves this to judgment, but its own criterion, that an edge exists when the other reliably reasons about my output, points toward passing.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9250,"completion_tokens":862,"total_tokens":10112,"cost":0.05424,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.05424,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.037,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01724},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":313,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}